rite a list **to organize** my day.","My sister uses her phone **to learn** words. And what do you use yours **for**? **Why** do you study English — **to travel**, **to work** or **to teach**?"],"kicker":"STUDY BLOG","by":"Lia","gloss":[["clear","limpar, esvaziar"],["organize","organizar"],["silence","silêncio"],["mind","mente"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Lia gets up early to study.","ans":"T","why":"to study."},{"q":"She walks to organize her day.","ans":"F","why":"to clear her mind."},{"q":"Her sister learns words on her phone.","ans":"T","why":"to learn words."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“clear” (verbo) = ?","opts":["limpar","claro","cortar"],"ans":0,"why":"clear."},{"q":"“mind” = ?","opts":["mente","minuto","mão"],"ans":0,"why":"mind."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Infinitive of purpose","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Pergunta","Resposta"],"rows":[["**Why** do you get up early?","**To study.**"],["**What for?**","**To read in silence.**"],["**Why** do you walk?","**To clear my mind.**"]],"cap":"Infinitive of purpose"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Propósito = **to + verbo**: *I walk **to** clear my mind.* Negativa: *in order not to*. Não use *for + verbo*: ✗ *for study*."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"*for + -ing* descreve a função: *a knife is for cutting.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I get up early ___ study. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."},{"s":"She walks ___ clear her mind. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."},{"s":"We write a list ___ organize. (to)","a":"to","why":"propósito."},{"s":"What do you use it ___ ? (for)","a":"for","why":"função."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["purpose","propósito"],["organize","organizar"],["focus","focar"],["mind","mente"],["routine","rotina"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["walk","Why","do","you"],"ans":"Why do you walk","pt":"Por que você caminha?"},{"words":["clear","my","mind","To"],"ans":"To clear my mind","pt":"Para esvaziar a mente."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"purpose","pos":"word","pt":"propósito","ex":"The purpose of a list.","expt":"O propósito de uma lista."},{"w":"wrong number","pos":"word","pt":"wrong number","ex":"número errado","expt":"You have the wrong number."},{"w":"wrong size","pos":"word","pt":"wrong size","ex":"tamanho errado","expt":"This is the wrong size."},{"w":"wrong order","pos":"word","pt":"wrong order","ex":"pedido errado","expt":"We got the wrong order."},{"w":"too hot","pos":"word","pt":"too hot","ex":"quente demais","expt":"The soup is too hot."},{"w":"too cold","pos":"word","pt":"too cold","ex":"frio demais","expt":"The room is too cold."},{"w":"too loud","pos":"word","pt":"too loud","ex":"alto demais","expt":"The music is too loud."},{"w":"too expensive","pos":"word","pt":"too expensive","ex":"caro demais","expt":"It is too expensive."},{"w":"too far","pos":"word","pt":"too far","ex":"longe demais","expt":"It is too far."},{"w":"too small","pos":"word","pt":"too small","ex":"pequeno demais","expt":"The shirt is too small."},{"w":"not enough","pos":"word","pt":"not enough","ex":"não é suficiente","expt":"Not enough time."},{"w":"no room","pos":"word","pt":"no room","ex":"sem espaço","expt":"There is no room."},{"w":"no seats","pos":"word","pt":"no seats","ex":"sem lugares","expt":"There are no seats."},{"w":"fix","pos":"word","pt":"fix","ex":"consertar","expt":"Fix the problem."},{"w":"solve","pos":"word","pt":"solve","ex":"resolver","expt":"Solve the puzzle."},{"w":"apologize","pos":"word","pt":"apologize","ex":"pedir desculpas","expt":"I apologize."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What for?** — Para quê?","**On 